  "assertions": [
    "Status: code 204, retryable=false, requires_repairing=false — re-pairing would not help; an administrator must change the authorization state.",
    "NO detail (pre-auth refusal); framed size <= 128 B (asserted).",
    "Non-fatal to the connection (no Close; state AUTHENTICATING) — but no record variant will authenticate this key.",
    "202 vs 204 (spec §6.2): unknown identity -> re-pairing yes; revoked/denied identity -> re-pairing no (admin action).",
    "Revocation also terminates active sessions within <= 5 s — see control.error-204-revoked-active-session."
  ],
